  "package": "AlgebraicGeometry",
  "entry": {
    "id": "AlgebraicGeometry.ppt.representativeInvariance",
    "kind": "property",
    "title": {
      "type": "i18n",
      "default_language": "en",
      "values": {
        "en": "Representative Invariance of Homogeneous Coordinates",
        "zh-CN": "齐次坐标的代表元不变性"
      }
    },
    "content": {
      "snl": "variable(__list__(Ne[authored_Neq_default](,λ@AlgebraicGeometry.ctxt.projectivePlane.lambda,$0$),Ne[authored_Neq_default](,VecNotation[default](X@AlgebraicGeometry.ctxt.projectivePlane.X,Y@AlgebraicGeometry.ctxt.projectivePlane.Y,Z@AlgebraicGeometry.ctxt.projectivePlane.Z),LA.Zero[default](LA.def.realVecSpaceRn($3$)))),theorem(Eq(,AlgebraicGeometry.RealProjectivePlane.homogeneousCoordinates(X@AlgebraicGeometry.ctxt.projectivePlane.X,Y@AlgebraicGeometry.ctxt.projectivePlane.Y,Z@AlgebraicGeometry.ctxt.projectivePlane.Z),AlgebraicGeometry.RealProjectivePlane.homogeneousCoordinates(LA.Smul[default](λ@AlgebraicGeometry.ctxt.projectivePlane.lambda,X@AlgebraicGeometry.ctxt.projectivePlane.X),LA.Smul[default](λ@AlgebraicGeometry.ctxt.projectivePlane.lambda,Y@AlgebraicGeometry.ctxt.projectivePlane.Y),LA.Smul[default](λ@AlgebraicGeometry.ctxt.projectivePlane.lambda,Z@AlgebraicGeometry.ctxt.projectivePlane.Z)))))",
      "markdown": {
        "type": "i18n",
        "default_language": "en",
        "values": {
          "en": "If $\\lambda\\in\\mathbb{R}\\setminus\\{0\\}$ and $(X,Y,Z)$ is a nonzero triple, then the triples $(X,Y,Z)$ and $(\\lambda X,\\lambda Y,\\lambda Z)$ determine the same homogeneous coordinates, that is $X:Y:Z=\\lambda X:\\lambda Y:\\lambda Z$ in $\\mathbb{P}^2_{\\mathbb{R}}$. This is the invariance that makes homogeneous coordinates well defined on the projective point rather than on a chosen representative.",
          "zh-CN": "若 $\\lambda\\in\\mathbb{R}\\setminus\\{0\\}$ 且 $(X,Y,Z)$ 为非零三元组，则 $(X,Y,Z)$ 与 $(\\lambda X,\\lambda Y,\\lambda Z)$ 确定同一齐次坐标，即在 $\\mathbb{P}^2_{\\mathbb{R}}$ 中有 $X:Y:Z=\\lambda X:\\lambda Y:\\lambda Z$。正是这一不变性使齐次坐标定义在射影点上，而非定义在某个取定的代表元上。"
        }
      }
    },
    "package": "AlgebraicGeometry",
    "contribution_info": null,
    "pointer": null
  }
}
